1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,900
3 mistakes first-timers make in China.
新手来中国常犯的三个错

3
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,200
Mistake 1: everyone piles onto Badaling.
错一：都挤去八达岭

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,500
It draws ~70% of all Wall visitors.
长城七成人都去那

5
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,000
Go Mutianyu or Jinshanling instead.
该去慕田峪或金山岭

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,300
Double-tap if you'd hike it.
想去爬的点个赞

7
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,800
Mistake 2: six cities in five days.
错二：五天赶六座城

8
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:18,100
Beijing to Shanghai alone is 4.5 hrs by rail.
京沪高铁就要4.5小时

9
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,600
Mistake 3: no Forbidden City booking.
错三：故宫没预约

10
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,900
Closed Mondays, and no walk-up tickets.
周一闭馆，不卖现票

11
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:25,400
★ Expert Tip: book online 7 days ahead, 8pm.
提前七天晚八点抢票

12
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:27,800
Which one did you almost do? Comment.
你差点中了哪个？评论区见
